      "writtenOn": "2024-08-26T04:55:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with William, I replaced flag with `enable_hap_by_default`, and `always_use_preset_cache` is very awkward to use here, as this needs to be disabled to make sense. I agree that couple of tests that require it can be left as-is, and follow-up CL will solve this when we have working solution",
      "parentUuid": "4c5bcb2a_0a360c60",
